error[PA018]: ambiguous `-` before `**`
 --> power-unary.lm:3:10
  |
3 | print(-2 ** 2)
  |          ^^ add parentheses to say which comes first
  |
  = note: write `-(… ** …)` to raise first, then apply `-`
  = note: write `(- …) ** …` to apply `-` first, then raise
  = note: Python reads `-2 ** 2` as the first, which is -4; Lumen will not guess
